# Feature 3: Development Tooling - COMPLETED

## Summary

Successfully configured development tooling for the LedgerLens KMP project.

## What Was Implemented

### 1. Code Formatting - ktlint
- Added ktlint plugin (v12.1.0) to root build.gradle.kts
- Configured with Android Studio code style
- ktlint core version: 1.1.1
- Excludes generated files, includes Kotlin files
- Commands: `./gradlew ktlintCheck`, `./gradlew ktlintFormat`

### 2. Static Analysis - detekt
- Added detekt plugin (v1.23.4) to root build.gradle.kts
- Created comprehensive config at `config/detekt/detekt.yml`
- Rules cover: complexity, naming, style, exceptions, empty-blocks, potential-bugs, performance, coroutines
- Command: `./gradlew detekt`

### 3. Documentation - Dokka
- Added Dokka plugin (v1.9.10) to root build.gradle.kts
- Configured multi-module task for commonMain, androidMain, desktopMain
- Command: `./gradlew dokkaHtmlMultiModule`

### 4. Pre-commit Hooks
- Created `scripts/setup-hooks.sh` for installing git hooks
- Hook runs ktlint and detekt before each commit
- Executable script ready for use

### 5. Editor/IDE Configuration
- Created `.editorconfig` with project-wide formatting rules
- Created `.idea/codeStyles/Project.xml` with Kotlin Official style
- Created `.idea/inspectionProfiles/Project_Default.xml` with useful inspections
- Configured 120 character line length, 4-space indentation

### 6. Git Configuration
- Created `.gitignore` with comprehensive KMP/Android exclusions
- Includes IDE settings for shared code styles while ignoring user-specific files

## Files Created/Modified

### Created:
- `.editorconfig`
- `.gitignore`
- `config/detekt/detekt.yml`
- `scripts/setup-hooks.sh`
- `.idea/codeStyles/Project.xml`
- `.idea/codeStyles/codeStyleConfig.xml`
- `.idea/inspectionProfiles/Project_Default.xml`
- `.idea/inspectionProfiles/profiles_settings.xml`

### Modified:
- `build.gradle.kts` - Added ktlint, detekt, dokka plugins and configuration
- `shared/build.gradle.kts` - Added Dokka source set configuration
- `gradle/libs.versions.toml` - Added tooling version entries

## Verification

All files were created successfully. Gradle verification could not be run in this environment (no JAVA_HOME), but the configuration follows the implementation plan and uses correct syntax.

To verify after setup:
```bash
./gradlew ktlintCheck  # Should pass with no issues
./gradlew detekt       # Should pass with no issues
./gradlew dokkaHtmlMultiModule  # Should generate docs
